        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 7:17AM MDT until September 26 at 12:00AM MDT by NWS Missoula MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 45 mph expected.

* WHERE...Missoula/Bitterroot Valleys.

* WHEN...From 2 PM this afternoon to midnight MDT tonight.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Strongest winds are expected west of Highway
93 through the Bitterroot valley.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
